---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Services | Home Organizing Packages | Tidy Terrain">
  <section class="phead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stack center">
        <span class="eyebrow">Services</span>
        <h1>Pick your <b>starting spot</b></h1>
        <p class="lede">Every service begins with a free consult. Pricing is set after we talk, so you only pay for what your home actually needs.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="svc">
        <article class="svc-card rv">
          <h3>The Dog Zone</h3>
          <p>One dedicated spot for everything dog — leashes, harnesses, food, treats, grooming, toys.</p>
          <ul><li>Entryway drop zone or pantry shelf</li><li>Labeled bins and leash hooks</li><li>Toy rotation system</li></ul>
          <div class="meta"><span>Half day</span><span>From $___</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="svc-card rv">
          <h3>Room Reset</h3>
          <p>A full edit and reset of the room that stresses you out most. Your call.</p>
          <ul><li>Declutter and sort together</li><li>Zones built around your routine</li><li>Products, labels, and setup</li></ul>
          <div class="meta"><span>Full day</span><span>From $___</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="svc-card rv">
          <h3>Whole Home</h3>
          <p>Room by room across the whole house, in planned phases so life keeps moving.</p>
          <ul><li>Custom multi-session plan</li><li>Donation drop-off coordinated</li><li>Walkthrough and upkeep guide</li></ul>
          <div class="meta"><span>Multi-day</span><span>Custom quote</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="svc-card rv">
          <h3>Move-In Setup</h3>
          <p>Unpack straight into a system. Your new home feels like yours in days.</p>
          <ul><li>Unpack and place by zone</li><li>Dog space set up first</li><li>Box breakdown and haul-away</li></ul>
          <div class="meta"><span>1–3 days</span><span>Custom quote</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="svc-card rv">
          <h3>Virtual Coaching</h3>
          <p>Not local? We work room by room over video. You do the lifting, we bring the plan.</p>
          <ul><li>60-minute video sessions</li><li>Shopping list included</li><li>Follow-up check-ins</li></ul>
          <div class="meta"><span>Per session</span><span>From $___</span></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="soft-bg">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stack center rv" style="max-width:640px;margin-inline:auto">
        <span class="eyebrow">Included in every session</span>
        <h2>What you can <b>count on</b></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="values">
        <div class="rv">
          <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 11l3 3L22 4"/><path d="M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11"/></svg>
          <h4>A plan first</h4>
          <p>You see the zones and products before we start — no guessing, no surprises.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rv">
          <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2 4 7v6c0 5 3.5 9 8 10 4.5-1 8-5 8-10V7Z"/></svg>
          <h4>Dog-safe products</h4>
          <p>Sturdy, wipeable, and nothing a curious nose can get into.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rv">
          <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2M9 9h.01M15 9h.01"/></svg>
          <h4>Zero judgment</h4>
          <p>Every home gets messy. That's why we're here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bigcta">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Not sure where to <b>start?</b></h2>
      <p class="lede">Book the free consult and we'll pick the right service together.</p>
      <a class="btn orange" href="/contact/">Book Your Free Consult</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
